<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond. [CORRECTED 13:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond. [CORRECTED 13:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY   *05.MAY.00</p>
<p> (Corrects coupon from 3.375 pct)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HANNOVER  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO MAY 1997, THEN 4.45 PCT IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 707</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
